# The server runs Linux: shell scripts, the Dockerfile and compose files break with Windows line endings
# (CRLF). Keep every text file LF on every PC; only Windows batch files need CRLF.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.zip binary
